{"tool_name":"nblast","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This R package implements the NBLAST neuron similarity algorithm described in a preprint available at <a href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.1101/006346\">http://dx.doi.org/10.1101/006346</a>. In addition to basic pairwise comparison, the package implements search of databases of neurons. There is also suport for all x all comparison for a group of neurons. This can produce a distance matrix suitable for hierarchical clustering, which is also implemented in the package.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This R package implements the NBLAST neuron similarity algorithm described in a preprint available at <a href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.1101/006346\">http://dx.doi.org/10.1101/006346</a>. In addition to basic pairwise comparison, the package implements search of databases of neurons. There is also suport for all x all comparison for a group of neurons. This can produce a distance matrix suitable for hierarchical clustering, which is also implemented in the package.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-10-18T15:39:39+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-30T08:59:39+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1517302938,"last_comment_uid":284,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Jefferis Gregory orcid.org/0000-0002-0587-9355"},{"value":"Costa Marta orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4369,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"48c26d93-5406-41f3-909e-17c44e39e123","url":"/taxonomy/term/4369"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://jefferislab.github.io/nat.nblast/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4190},{"target_id":4351},{"t